# Scenario: programme office explains overlapping eligibility criteria for a youth innovation grant.
venn "Youth innovation grant eligibility"
set resident "City resident"
set youth "Age 18–30"
set proposal "Eligible project proposal"
resident only: "Resident outside age range"
youth only: "Age-qualified non-resident"
proposal only: "Proposal from outside area"
resident & youth: "Eligible person; proposal needed"
resident & proposal: "Resident project lead; age needed"
youth & proposal: "Young proposer; residency needed"
resident & youth & proposal: "Eligible to apply"
